                    <div class="inner">
                        <div class="title aos-init" aos="" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <h2>웨딩 인터뷰</h2>
                        </div>

                        <div class="textarea aos-init" aos="" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="img_box">
                                <img src="../../img/flower/_5.png" alt="">
                            </div>
                            <p>두 분의 인터뷰를 준비했습니다.</p>
                            <p>인터뷰를 확인해보세요.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="v1 qna_wrap aos-init aos-animate" aos="" var="qna1" style="display:none" data-aos="fade-up">
                            <div class="btn_box">
                                <a class="l_btn" href="javascript:;" onclick="common.openStaticModal('modal_interview')">인터뷰 읽어보기</a>
