		<div class="modal_dimmed preview_resize modal_rsvp" style="touch-action : pan-x pan-y;">
			<div class="m_wrap">
				<div class="modal_title">
					<h2 var="rsvpSubject">참석 여부 전달</h2>
					<button class=" close_btn" type="button" onclick="rsvp.reset(); common.closeStaticModal(this)"><i class="xi-close"></i></button>
				</div>
				<form id="rsvpForm" onsubmit="return false">
					<input type="hidden" id="invitationId" name="invitationId" value="13590">
					<div class="form">

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="usekind">
							<div class="chk_title">
								어느 측 하객이신가요? <span class="essential">*</span>
							</div>
							<div class="chk who row_couple_name">
								<input type="radio" value="G" id="kind1" name="kind">
								<label for="kind1"><span var="groomText">신랑</span></label>
								<input type="radio" value="B" id="kind2" name="kind">
								<label for="kind2"><span var="brideText">신부</span></label>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="useIsAttend">
							<div class="chk_title">
								참석여부 <span class="essential">*</span>
							</div>
							<div class="chk attend">
								<input type="radio" value="Y" id="isAttend1" name="isAttend">
								<label for="isAttend1">참석</label>
								<input type="radio" value="N" id="isAttend2" name="isAttend">
								<label for="isAttend2">불참석</label>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="useIsMeal">
							<div class="chk_title">
								식사여부 <span class="essential">*</span>
							</div>
							<div class="chk eat">
								<input type="radio" value="Y" id="isMeal1" name="isMeal">
								<label for="isMeal1"><i class="xi-radiobox-blank"></i></label>
								<input type="radio" value="N" id="isMeal2" name="isMeal">
								<label for="isMeal2"><i class="xi-close"></i></label>
								<input type="radio" value="Q" id="isMeal3" name="isMeal">
								<label for="isMeal3">미정</label>
							</div>
						</div>

						

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="useName">
							<div class="chk_title">
								성함 <span class="essential">*</span>
							</div>
							<input type="text" id="name" name="name" value="" maxlength="254">
						</div>

						

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="usePeopleName">
							<div class="chk_title">
								동행인 성함
							</div>
							<input type="text" id="peopleName" name="peopleName" value="" maxlength="254">
						</div>

						

						

						

						<div class="chk_wrap" var="useMemo">
							<div class="chk_title">
								전달사항
							</div>
							<textarea id="memo" name="memo"></textarea>
						</div>

						

						
							<div class="chk_wrap">
								<input type="checkbox" id="agree" name="agree" value="Y" onclick="rsvp.checkAgree(this)">
								<label for="agree"><i class="xi-check"></i>개인정보 수집 및 활용 동의 </label>
								<a class="btn_term" onclick="common.openStaticModal('modal_rsvp_term1')">[자세히보기]</a>
							</div>
						

						<div class="btn_box">
							<a href="javascript:;" onclick="rsvp.submit()">전달</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</form>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="mini_popup rsvp_popup modal_rsvp_term1">
			<div class="popup_wrap">
				<div class="title">
					<h2>(필수) 개인정보 수집 및 활용 동의</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="desc">
					<p>
						[수집 항목]<br>이름, 전화번호등 RSVP에 입력 된 항목<br><br>
						[이용 목적]<br>결혼식 참석 여부 확인 및 관련 서비스 제공<br><br>
						[보유 및 이용 기간]<br>동의일로부터 청첩장 유효기간 동안<br><br>
						[동의 거부권 및 불이익 사항]<br>동의 거부 시 서비스 이용 불가
					</p>
				</div>
				<button class=" close_btn" type="button" onclick="$('.modal_rsvp_term1').removeClass('active'); common.controlScroll('on');"><i class="xi-close"></i></button>
			</div>
		</div>

		

	</div>



    </div>
</div>




